{"chunk":"Each appeal for an exception shall be filed in quadruplicate with the Building Commissioner,\n               who shall retain one copy for his files and transmit the other copies as follows:\n               one to the Board of Appeal, one to the Boston Redevelopment Authority, and the other\n               to the Zoning Commission. Said Authority shall, within thirty days after the date\n               of such transmittal, file with the Board of Appeal a report with recommendations,\n               together with material, maps or plans to aid the Board of Appeal in judging the appeal\n               and determining what conditions and safeguards may be necessary or appropriate.","document":"ARTICLE_6A_-_OTHER_EXCEPTIONS","city":"boston","heading_1":"ARTICLE 6A OTHER EXCEPTIONS","heading_2":"Section 6A-2. Procedure for Appeal.","url":"https:\/\/library.municode.com\/MA\/Boston\/codes\/Redevelopment_Authority?nodeId=ART6AOTEX_S6A-2PRAP","district_code":[],"district_category":[],"embedding":[0.0320875309,-0.013906626,0.0451855026,-0.0204274449,-0.0380606502,-0.0061742361,0.0442345664,0.0271849446,-0.0048308815,0.0400985368,0.0070632938,0.0422170013,0.0617408156,-0.0500180312,0.012914638,-0.0133216856,0.0321388021,0.0410815403,0.0034424865,-0.0516931228,0.0105166594,0.0020383366,-0.004127719,-0.061628852,0.0270973239,-0.0429260097,0.0106234746,-0.0678977743,-0.0256324839,0.0016264574,0.0595951527,0.0111073833,0.0242681466,-0.0728547946,0.0462412648,0.0553650409,-0.0414436497,-0.0611886643,0.0304428339,-0.0463372432,-0.0173389819,0.0411208458,-0.0127390036,0.0671512932,0.0173718333,0.0125293536,0.0170598235,0.0403853059,-0.0563739277,0.0324273705,0.0336153656,0.0237058066,-0.0566583611,0.0062877275,-0.0380093381,-0.0208043251,-0.053268794,-0.0466996655,0.0217287261,-0.0282065812,0.0271522366,-0.020196896,0.0121405218,0.0452491716,0.0134932455,0.0031791495,-0.0290112738,-0.0934840068,0.0008877074,0.0326532461,0.0150410496,0.0572268255,-0.019096192,0.0709338561,0